# Inverted chat: history loads at the top, incoming bursts, then scroll to top.
route Chat
latency 250,700
wait 2
mark incoming-at-bottom
press 333 80
wait 2
mark scroll-into-history
repeat 4 pan 200 250 0 450 250
wait 3
mark load-earlier-burst
repeat 3 press 296 80
wait 3
mark incoming-while-up
press 333 80
wait 2
mark stt
statusbar
wait 4
mark back-to-bottom
repeat 8 pan 200 700 0 -600 100
wait 2
mark incoming-burst-at-bottom
repeat 3 press 333 80
wait 3
